% expect-output: [/DeviceRGB]
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: [/DeviceRGB]
% expect-output: /typecheck
% expect-output: /typecheck
% Scenario: the ColorSpace category is regular (PLRM3 section 3.9.2):
% an array is defined and found, selected with setcolorspace, and
% reported by currentcolorspace; anything but an array is typecheck.
/X [/DeviceRGB] /ColorSpace defineresource pop
/X /ColorSpace findresource ==
/X /ColorSpace resourcestatus 3 1 roll pop pop ==
/X /ColorSpace findresource setcolorspace currentcolorspace ==
{ /Y /DeviceRGB /ColorSpace defineresource } stopped pop $error /errorname get ==
{ /Z 5 /ColorSpace defineresource } stopped pop $error /errorname get ==
